## ObjectType: Security Identifier

Local DEMO-SEC security identifier with a named synthetic scheme; not a real ISIN.

### Semantic Provenance

| Key | Value |
|---|---|
| source_iri | https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/SEC/Securities/SecuritiesIdentification/SecurityIdentifier |
| source_label | security identifier |
| source_definition | any publicly available identifier that is used to identify a security |
| source_revision | 2d73435a4419b66b7c9f44cb9763e35fe8ac7890 |
| source_license | MIT |
| source_repository | https://github.com/edmcouncil/fibo |

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| identifier_id | Identifier Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | identifier_id |
| instrument_id | Instrument Id | string | Foreign key to financial_instruments; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | instrument_id |
| synthetic_code | Synthetic Code | string | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | synthetic_code |
| scheme | Scheme | string | Declared identifier scheme, not the DEMO prefix of synthetic_code. Use the complete allowed scheme value. Allowed values: local_security_code. | scheme |
| is_synthetic | Is Synthetic | boolean | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | is_synthetic |

